From: ANSGAR.HEBBORN at Roche.COM (Hebborn, Ansgar {PBSE~Basel})
Date: Thu, 18 Oct 2001 15:34:01 +0200
Subject: SUMMARY: Vectorizing a loop - SUMMARY
Message-ID: <154AEAF56141D511AAF20002A55CBDEEA83EA7@rbamsem1.bas.roche.com>

Dear S-PLUS users,

impressed and grateful for the fast and comprehensive support I got from other 
list members I would like to summarize the answers I got with regard to my 
problem with "vectorizing a loop". 

Thanks and best regards

> Ansgar
> 
Dr. Ansgar Hebborn
